    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11524" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαρθένευτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unmaidenly, unfitting a
				maiden,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1739
			</span></i> (lyr.), neut. pl. as Adv., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>IA</u>
				993
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>deflowered,</i> Sch. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				2.41
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
