				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορεύω</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				304
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Carm.Pop.</u>
				8
			</span></i>.</div>
